<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>¡Hola Chino! 台灣生活與交通完全指南</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0b1120;
      --card-bg: #1e293b;
      --card-sub: #0f172a;
      --accent: #10b981;
      --accent-hover: #059669;
      --bubble-tourist: #2563eb;
      --bubble-local: #334155;
      --text-main: #f8fafc;
      --text-sub: #94a3b8;
      --zhuyin: #f59e0b;
      --pinyin: #38bdf8;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
    body { background-color: var(--bg); color: var(--text-main); padding-bottom: 80px; }
    header { background-color: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.95); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); padding: 14px 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #334155; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
    .btn-group { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    .toggle-btn { background: #334155; color: #fff; border: 1px solid #475569; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.85rem; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; font-weight: 600; }
    .toggle-btn.active { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #000; }

    .container { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
    
    /* 頂部主模組選單 */
    .main-nav { display: flex; gap: 8px; overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 6px; }
    .main-nav-btn { background: #1e293b; color: #94a3b8; border: 1px solid #334155; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.95rem; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 700; transition: 0.2s; }
    .main-nav-btn.active { background: var(--accent); color: #000; border-color: var(--accent); }

    .card { background-color: var(--card-bg); border-radius: 18px; padding: 22px; border: 1px solid #334155; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }
    .card-title { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; color: #f8fafc; }

    /* 次級標籤選單 */
    .sub-tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px; overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 4px; }
    .sub-btn { background: #334155; color: #cbd5e1; border: none; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.88rem; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; }
    .sub-btn.active { background: #3b82f6; color: #fff; }

    /* 萬用語句生成器 */
    .builder-box { background: var(--card-sub); padding: 18px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid #1e293b; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
    .display-zh { font-size: 1.45rem; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.5px; }
    .display-pho { font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.4; }
    .pho-py { color: var(--pinyin); margin-right: 8px; font-weight: 500; }
    .pho-zy { color: var(--zhuyin); }
    .display-es { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-sub); font-style: italic; }
    .audio-btn { background: #334155; border: none; cursor: pointer; font-size: 1rem; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 20px; color: #fff; transition: 0.2s; margin-left: 6px; }
    .audio-btn:hover { background: var(--accent); color: #000; }

    .chip-block { margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .chip-label { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #94a3b8; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; display: block; }
    .chip-container { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
    .chip { background: #334155; border: 1px solid #475569; padding: 7px 13px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.88rem; cursor: pointer; color: #e2e8f0; transition: 0.15s; }
    .chip.selected { background: #3b82f6; border-color: #60a5fa; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; }

    /* 對話氣泡 */
    .chat-container { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    .chat-bubble { max-width: 88%; padding: 12px 16px; border-radius: 16px; line-height: 1.45; }
    .chat-bubble.tourist { align-self: flex-start; background: var(--bubble-tourist); border-bottom-left-radius: 4px; }
    .chat-bubble.local { align-self: flex-end; background: var(--bubble-local); border-bottom-right-radius: 4px; }
    .speaker-name { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 4px; font-weight: 600; }
    .bubble-text { font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; }
    .bubble-pho { font-size: 0.82rem; margin-top: 4px; }
    .bubble-es { font-size: 0.82rem; color: #cbd5e1; margin-top: 4px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); padding-top: 4px; font-style: italic; }

    /* 單字標籤網格 */
    .word-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(170px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .word-chip { background: var(--card-sub); border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
    .word-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .word-zh { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }

    /* 美食卡片網格 */
    .food-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
    .food-card { background: var(--card-sub); border: 1px solid #334155; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    @media (min-width: 640px) { .food-card { flex-direction: row; } }
    .food-img-wrapper { position: relative; width: 100%; height: 200px; overflow: hidden; background: #1e293b; flex-shrink: 0; }
    @media (min-width: 640px) { .food-img-wrapper { width: 240px; height: auto; } }
    .food-img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
    .food-content { padding: 16px; flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }

    .food-example { background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.7); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; margin-top: 8px; }
    .food-example-title { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 2px; }

    /* 地名網格 */
    .loc-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(170px, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
    .loc-card { background: var(--card-sub); padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #334155; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.2s; }
    .loc-card:hover { border-color: var(--pinyin); background: #1a2436; }

    /* 文法解說方塊 */
    .grammar-box { background: var(--card-sub); border-left: 4px solid var(--accent); padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0; margin-bottom: 10px; }

    /* 小撇步 */
    .tip-item { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; background: var(--card-sub); padding: 14px; border-radius: 12px; }
    .tip-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; }

    /* 隱藏區塊 */
    .tab-content { display: none; }
    .tab-content.active { display: block; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <h1>¡Hola Chino! 🇹🇼</h1>
    <div class="btn-group">
      <button id="toggleChar" class="toggle-btn" onclick="toggleCharMode()">繁體</button>
      <button id="toggleSpeed" class="toggle-btn" onclick="toggleSpeedMode()">🐢 0.6x</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="container">
    
    <!-- 主導覽分頁 -->
    <div class="main-nav">
      <button class="main-nav-btn active" onclick="switchMainTab('order')">🧋 點餐買東西</button>
      <button class="main-nav-btn" onclick="switchMainTab('food_place')">🗺️ 地名與小吃圖鑑</button>
      <button class="main-nav-btn" onclick="switchMainTab('traffic')">🚦 交通規則與路況</button>
      <button class="main-nav-btn" onclick="switchMainTab('challenge')">✍️ 造句挑戰</button>
      <button class="main-nav-btn" onclick="switchMainTab('tips')">💡 生活免尷尬撇步</button>
    </div>

    <!-- 模組 1：點餐買東西實戰 -->
    <div id="tab-order" class="tab-content active">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">🧩 邏輯句型填空 (Constructor de Frases)</div>
        <div class="sub-tabs">
          <button class="sub-btn active" onclick="switchOrderSc('boba')">🧋 飲料店模式</button>
          <button class="sub-btn" onclick="switchOrderSc('restaurant')">🍛 小吃店模式</button>
        </div>

        <div class="builder-box">
          <div class="display-zh" id="orderResZh">---</div>
          <div class="display-pho">
            <span class="pho-py" id="orderResPy">---</span>
            <span class="pho-zy" id="orderResZy">---</span>
            <button class="audio-btn" onclick="speakText(document.getElementById('orderResZh').innerText)">🔊</button>
          </div>
          <div class="display-es" id="orderResEs">---</div>
        </div>

        <div class="chip-block">
          <span class="chip-label">選擇句型 (Elige el patrón)：</span>
          <div class="chip-container" id="orderPatChips"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="chip-block">
          <span class="chip-label">填入符合邏輯的單字 (Elige el vocabulario)：</span>
          <div class="chip-container" id="orderItemChips"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <div class="card-title">💬 點餐實戰對話 (Diálogos de Compra)</div>
        <div class="sub-tabs">
          <button class="sub-btn active" onclick="loadOrderDialog(0)">🧋 1. 手搖飲店 (標準應對)</button>
          <button class="sub-btn" onclick="loadOrderDialog(1)">🍛 2. 小吃店 / 牛肉麵 (招牌與結帳)</button>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-container" id="orderChatBox"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 模組 2：台灣地名與五大小吃圖鑑 -->
    <div id="tab-food_place" class="tab-content">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">🗺️ 實戰問路覓食 (Preguntar por comida y lugares)</div>
        <p style="font-size: 0.88rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 12px;">點選下方想去的地名與小吃，立刻生成自然道地的旅遊問句：</p>
        <div class="builder-box">
          <div class="display-zh" id="askZh">不好意思，請問西門町有賣滷肉飯嗎？</div>
          <div class="display-pho">
            <span class="pho-py" id="askPy">Bù hǎoy
